; the row comes down to the work buffer  and B is emptied as it goes
  [-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]>[-L44+R44]

